{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901019400010","name":"透","text":"え、本命？\r\nこれって","trans":"诶，本命？\n这个算吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え？　あぁ……\r\n本命とかあるのか？　ホワイトデーって","trans":"诶？　啊啊……\n白色情人节还有本命这种说法吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019400020","name":"透","text":"え？\r\nないの","trans":"诶？\n没有吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うーん……いや\r\n俺が知らないだけかもしれないけど","trans":"唔嗯……不\n也许只是我不知道而已","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019400030","name":"透","text":"じゃ\r\nあったら、本命？","trans":"那\n要是有的话，就算本命？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、透ー","trans":"哈哈，透——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……いや、うん\r\n本命だよ","trans":"……不，嗯\n是本命哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-23","name":"プロデューサー","text":"透をしっかり\r\nプロデュースしていきたい","trans":"我想好好地\n继续制作透","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019400050","name":"透","text":"まぁ、いいや","trans":"算了，随便吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}